# Optional overrides for text printed on the source CIPLs.
#
# The defaults are generic so this repository carries no customer's name. Set these only if
# your documents need a stricter marker than the default; copy this file to `.env.local`,
# which is not committed.

# Label preceding the shipment number in the Vendor B header block.
# VITE_CIPL_SHIPMENT_LABEL=SHIPMENT#

# Extra row text that closes a line-item table, for layouts that end it with the exporter's
# own name. Matched case-insensitively, in addition to TOTAL NET VALUE and SUMMARY INFORMATION.
# VITE_CIPL_TABLE_END_MARKER=
